  "title": "BEASTBOUND – Episode 08: The Island That Breathes",
  "description": "The ocean turns against them.<br><br>Pulled by an unstoppable current, the Black Tide crashes into massive bone reefs. As the ship begins to break apart, Lyra unleashes her power over the sea to save everyone on board.<br><br>But survival comes at a price.<br><br>With the Black Tide badly damaged, Kade and his companions must venture onto a mysterious island in search of materials to repair their ship.<br><br>What begins as a simple mission quickly becomes a dangerous adventure.<br><br>Armored beasts roam the forests. Enormous ancient bones stretch across the landscape. And deep beneath the island, something extraordinary awaits.<br><br>The crew soon discovers a secret that changes everything they thought they knew about the ocean.<br><br>And an ancient clue may lead Lyra back to the legendary Siren Kingdom.<br><br>Some islands hide secrets. This one is a secret.<br><br>Welcome to BEASTBOUND — a cinematic dark fantasy adventure filled with dragons, pirates, ancient creatures, and forgotten civilizations.<br><br>Subscribe and join Kade, Lyra, and the crew of the Black Tide as they journey across the Shattered Seas.<br><br>Next Episode: EP09 – KINGDOM BELOW<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beastbound\">#BEASTBOUND</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fantasyadventure\">#FantasyAdventure</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/aifilm\">#AIFilm</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/piratefantasy\">#PirateFantasy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/seamonsters\">#SeaMonsters</a>",
